    },
    {
      "text": "Combine mango, remaining 1 tomato, remaining ½ bunch chopped cilantro, bell pepper, corn, sugar, and cumin in a medium bowl; stir in serrano mixture; season with salt and black pepper. Chill before serving for 1 hour.",
